#: docs/zh/development/validation.md:37
msgid "构建和安装"
msgstr "Build and installation"

#: docs/zh/development/validation.md:39
msgid ""
"在只准备 C11 工具链的干净构建目录验证默认生产库、Boot 生产库和源码子目录。独立安装消费实际编译、链接并运行公开 C11 和 C++17 程序，覆盖 "
"ABI、profile、必需能力、资源身份和前缀冲突。正常主机测试按 [开发工作流](workflow.md) 执行。缺少本次测试清单、运行报告或失败退出码时，保留真实状态。"
msgstr ""
"Use a clean build with only the C11 toolchain to validate the default production library, Boot "
"production library and source subdirectory. Compile, link and run isolated C11 and C++17 consumers "
"against the installed SDK. Exercise rejected ABI, profile, required capability, resource identity and "
"prefix combinations. Follow the [development workflow](workflow.md) for host tests. Keep missing test "
"inventories, missing reports and failing exit statuses visible."

#: docs/zh/development/validation.md:41
msgid "`ci` preset 选择 Full 档位，开启高级运行时和 GCC 覆盖率插桩。`run_ctest.py` 保存用例清单和 JUnit 报告，并拒绝跳过的测试。多配置构建逐配置保存结果。"
msgstr ""
"The `ci` preset selects Full with advanced runtime and GCC coverage instrumentation. `run_ctest.py` "
"records the inventory and JUnit report and rejects skipped tests. Save results for each configuration "
"when using a multi-config generator."

#: docs/zh/development/validation.md:49
msgid ""
"本地使用 CMake 时，运行 `cmake --build --preset ci --target xgl_release_validation` 构建并执行已注册的 CTest 用例，包含 SDK "
"搬移消费和无堆检查。如启用了本机构建的 `xgl_footprint` 目标，可用它报告静态库文件大小。"
msgstr ""
"For a local CMake check, `cmake --build --preset ci --target xgl_release_validation` builds and runs the"
" registered CTest cases, including the relocated SDK and no-heap smoke tests. When enabled, the native "
"`xgl_footprint` target reports the static archive size."

#: docs/zh/development/validation.md:51
msgid ""
"使用 `boot-small-host-test` 的配置、构建和测试 preset 验证单窗口槽与固定 RTO。`asan` preset 会让 AddressSanitizer 和 "
"UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer 的诊断使测试失败。SDK 冒烟测试也会将两个独立消费者链接到经过插桩的库并运行。记录实际执行的 profile、编译器和 "
"sanitizer。GoogleTest 依赖见 `test/CMakeLists.txt`。"
msgstr ""
"Use the `boot-small-host-test` configure, build and test presets for one window slot with fixed RTO. The"
" `asan` preset makes AddressSanitizer and UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer findings fail the tests. The SDK "
"smoke test also links and runs both independent consumers against the instrumented library. Record the "
"profiles, compiler and sanitizer runs that executed. See `test/CMakeLists.txt` for the GoogleTest "
"dependency."

#: docs/zh/development/validation.md:53
msgid ""
"同时保留每个配置的 `compile_commands.json`。静态分析使用当前生产翻译单元、生成头与编译标志。Windows、macOS、GCC 覆盖率、Native Release 和 TSan "
"的执行范围按 CI 对应任务核对。资源变更使用真实 ARM 编译链接及目标 map 复核，见下节。"
msgstr ""
"Also retain `compile_commands.json` for each configuration. Static analysis uses the production "
"translation units, generated headers and actual compile flags. See the corresponding CI jobs for "
"Windows, macOS, GCC coverage, Native Release and TSan. Verify resource changes with real ARM "
"compilation, linking and a target map as described below."

#: docs/zh/development/validation.md:55
msgid "资源和产品验收"
msgstr "Resources and product qualification"

#: docs/zh/development/validation.md:57
msgid ""
"用产品目标工具链、最终链接 map 和实际应用配置测量固件。比较时保持档位、帧与接收缓冲大小和优化选项一致。记录 Flash、workspace、静态 RAM 和栈空间，再在板上核对驱动缓冲、ISR "
"嵌套及栈峰值。"
msgstr ""
"Measure the product firmware with its target toolchain, linker map and actual application settings. "
"Compare builds with the same profile, frame and RX sizes, and optimization settings. Record Flash, "
"workspace, static RAM and stack, then validate driver buffers, ISR nesting and peak stack on the board."

#: docs/zh/development/validation.md:59
msgid "真实板卡、Flash 断电、DMA 借用、生产认证和重启后 nonce 新鲜性由产品验收。模拟与软件检查、ARM 链接、远端 CI、发布和硬件执行各自关联实际提交与产物。"
msgstr ""
"Product qualification covers the actual board, Flash power interruption, DMA borrows, production "
"authentication and nonce freshness after restart. Bind simulation and software checks, ARM linkage, "
"remote CI, release and hardware execution to their actual inputs and artifacts."

#: docs/zh/development/validation.md:61
msgid "历史证据"
msgstr "Historical evidence"

